The speech model installed as /usr/share/omaedit/whisper/ggml-base.bin is
OpenAI's Whisper "base" model (multilingual), as the whisper.cpp project
converted it to ggml format and publishes it, unmodified:
https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp, file ggml-base.bin at commit
5359861c739e955e79d9a303bcbc70fb988958b1 (SHA-256
60ed5bc3dd14eea856493d334349b405782ddcaf0028d4b5df4088345fba2efe).
The model and the conversion are under the MIT licence. OpenAI's licence for
the Whisper model, then whisper.cpp's, follow.

